{"attachments":[],"body":"# 부록 A. 전체 스키마·ERD·인덱스·트리거\n\n\n## 재현 범위와 검증\n\n현재 작업 트리의 `src-tauri/src/database/migration.rs`와 SQL 000..040을 읽어, 새 `/tmp/dorea-schema-audit.sqlite`에 Python sqlite3로 fresh-install 분기를 재현했다. 원본 사용자 DB를 읽거나 수정하지 않았다. Rust MigrationRunner를 실행한 것이 아니며 기존 설치 업그레이드·실제 데이터 무결성·실기기 성능 검증으로 해석하면 안 된다. Python SQLite 버전은 3.53.3이다. SQLite FK ON, 각 migration 명시적 트랜잭션으로 수행했다.\n\n- `PRAGMA integrity_check`: `ok`\n- `PRAGMA foreign_key_check`: 0행\n- 앱/내부 관리 테이블 31개 + SQLite 자동 `sqlite_sequence` 1개\n- 인덱스 86개: 명시적 54개 + SQLite PK/UNIQUE 자동 32개\n- 트리거 47개\n- 배포 schema가 아니라 현재 WIP의 040 포함 schema다. seed만 있는 DB이므로 성능 수치를 도출하지 않았다.\n\n`014`, `016` 파일은 현재 runner 등록 목록에 없으며 `029`는 별도 SQL 없이 028을 조건부 재실행한다. 037과 038은 각 파일을 단순 순서 실행하지 않고 runner와 동일하게 037 SQL + 035 중복 정리 helper를 실행한다. 035 helper의 임시 `_eventodo_schedule_dup_map` 정리까지 반영했다. 017의 공통 SQL은 실행되고, 추가 legacy 대상 분기는 fresh schema에 해당 테이블이 없어 실행되지 않는다.\n\n## 물리 FK ERD\n\n실선은 SQLite가 선언한 FK다. `||`는 필수 부모, `o|`는 nullable 부모이며 자식은 0..N이다. Polymorphic 참조와 JSON 참조는 다음 별도 다이어그램에만 표시한다. FK가 없는 테이블도 전체 엔티티 목록에 포함했다.\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    _migrations {\n        INTEGER id PK\n    }\n    app_settings {\n        TEXT key PK\n    }\n    device_config {\n        TEXT key PK\n    }\n    diary_feedback_responses {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT diary_feedback_id FK\n    }\n    diary_feedbacks {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    diary_money_budgets {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    diary_occurrence_records {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    diary_schedules {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    eventodos {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    google_task_lists {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    habit_log_tags {\n        TEXT record_id PK,FK\n        TEXT tag_id PK,FK\n    }\n    habit_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT habit_id FK\n    }\n    habit_tags {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT habit_id FK\n    }\n    habits {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    ideas {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT note_id FK\n        TEXT tag_id FK\n    }\n    insight_contexts {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    lan_sync_nonces {\n        TEXT device_id PK,FK\n        TEXT nonce PK\n    }\n    meal_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    money_categories {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    money_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT category_id FK\n    }\n    money_recurring_items {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT category_id FK\n    }\n    money_recurring_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT recurring_id FK\n        TEXT money_log_id FK\n    }\n    notes {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    pending_conflicts {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    routines {\n        TEXT activity PK\n        TEXT activity_ref_id PK\n        TEXT duration PK\n        TEXT start_time PK\n        TEXT effective_start_date PK\n    }\n    sleep_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    sync_meta {\n        TEXT key PK\n    }\n    sync_peers {\n        TEXT device_id PK\n    }\n    sync_state {\n        INTEGER id PK\n    }\n    tags {\n        TEXT id PK\n        TEXT note_id FK\n    }\n    timer_logs {\n        TEXT id PK\n    }\n    diary_feedbacks ||--o{ diary_feedback_responses : \"diary_feedback_id\"\n    habit_tags ||--o{ habit_log_tags : \"tag_id\"\n    habit_logs ||--o{ habit_log_tags : \"record_id\"\n    habits ||--o{ habit_logs : \"habit_id\"\n    habits ||--o{ habit_tags : \"habit_id\"\n    tags o|--o{ ideas : \"tag_id\"\n    notes ||--o{ ideas : \"note_id\"\n    sync_peers ||--o{ lan_sync_nonces : \"device_id\"\n    money_categories ||--o{ money_logs : \"category_id\"\n    money_categories ||--o{ money_recurring_items : \"category_id\"\n    money_logs o|--o{ money_recurring_logs : \"money_log_id\"\n    money_recurring_items ||--o{ money_recurring_logs : \"recurring_id\"\n    notes ||--o{ tags : \"note_id\"\n```\n\n## 논리적 참조 (FK 없음)\n\n다음 연결은 앱이 activity discriminator, ID 또는 JSON을 해석해 유지하는 논리 관계다. FK 보장/자동 CASCADE를 뜻하지 않는다. routine key는 단일 PK가 아니라 activity/ref/duration/start/effective-start의 복합 식별자다. 040의 plan alias는 의도적으로 cascading FK를 두지 않는다.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  diary_schedules -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> notes\n  diary_schedules -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> habits\n  diary_schedules -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> eventodos\n  routines -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> notes\n  routines -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> habits\n  routines -. \"activity + activity_ref_id\" .-> eventodos\n  diary_occurrence_records -. schedule_id .-> diary_schedules\n  diary_occurrence_records -. routine_key .-> routines\n  diary_occurrence_records -. \"habit record_kind + record_id\" .-> habit_logs\n  diary_occurrence_records -. \"idea record_kind + record_id\" .-> ideas\n  diary_occurrence_records -. \"event activity_ref_id\" .-> eventodos\n  timer_logs -. \"cycles JSON sourceScheduleId\" .-> diary_schedules\n  timer_logs -. \"cycles JSON source identity\" .-> notes\n  timer_logs -. \"cycles JSON source identity\" .-> habits\n  timer_logs -. \"cycles JSON source identity\" .-> eventodos\n  eventodos -. google_task_list_id .-> google_task_lists\n```\n\n## 전체 테이블·열·PK·FK\n\n`NN`은 PRAGMA notnull, `PK(n)`은 복합키 순서다. SQLite 일반 rowid 테이블의 TEXT PK는 명시 NOT NULL이 없으면 nullable일 수 있으므로 PK라고 자동 NN으로 표기하지 않았다. 원문 CREATE TABLE을 함께 수록해 CHECK/UNIQUE/default의 세부 조건을 보존한다.\n\n### _migrations\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | INTEGER | PK(1) | — |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `applied_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE _migrations(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,name TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,applied_at INTEGER NOT NULL);\n```\n\n### app_settings\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `key` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `value` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `device_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE app_settings (\n    key TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    value TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    device_id TEXT\n);\n```\n\n### device_config\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `key` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `value` | TEXT | NN | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE device_config (\n    key TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    value TEXT NOT NULL\n);\n```\n\n### diary_feedback_responses\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `diary_feedback_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `feedback_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `feedback_period_type` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `device_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `content` | TEXT | NN | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| diary_feedback_id | diary_feedbacks.id | CASCADE | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE diary_feedback_responses (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    diary_feedback_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    feedback_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    feedback_period_type TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    device_id TEXT,\n    content TEXT NOT NULL,\n    FOREIGN KEY (diary_feedback_id) REFERENCES diary_feedbacks(id)\n        ON UPDATE CASCADE ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### diary_feedbacks\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `period_type` | TEXT | NN | 'day' |\n| `content` | TEXT | NN | '' |\n| `satisfaction` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `likes` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `recommendation_result` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"diary_feedbacks\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    period_type TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'day',\n    content TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',\n    satisfaction INTEGER,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    likes INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    recommendation_result TEXT,\n    UNIQUE(date, period_type)\n);\n```\n\n### diary_money_budgets\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `year_month` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `total_budget` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"diary_money_budgets\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    year_month TEXT NOT NULL,\n    total_budget INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### diary_occurrence_records\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `logical_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `activity` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `activity_ref_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `schedule_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `routine_key` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `record_kind` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `record_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `actual_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `actual_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE diary_occurrence_records (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    logical_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    activity TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (activity IN ('habit', 'note', 'event')),\n    activity_ref_id TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (length(activity_ref_id) > 0),\n    schedule_id TEXT,\n    routine_key TEXT,\n    record_kind TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (record_kind IN ('habit', 'idea', 'event')),\n    record_id TEXT,\n    actual_date TEXT,\n    actual_time TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    CHECK (schedule_id IS NOT NULL OR routine_key IS NOT NULL),\n    CHECK ((record_kind = 'habit' AND activity = 'habit' AND record_id IS NOT NULL AND actual_date IS NULL AND actual_time IS NULL)\n        OR (record_kind = 'idea' AND activity = 'note' AND record_id IS NOT NULL AND actual_date IS NULL AND actual_time IS NULL)\n        OR (record_kind = 'event' AND activity = 'event' AND record_id IS NULL AND actual_date IS NOT NULL AND actual_time IS NOT NULL))\n);\n```\n\n### diary_schedules\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `activity` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `activity_ref_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `specific_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `start_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `end_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `end_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `note` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"diary_schedules\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    activity TEXT NOT NULL,\n    activity_ref_id TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n, specific_date TEXT, start_time TEXT, end_time TEXT, end_date TEXT, note TEXT);\n```\n\n### eventodos\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `title` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `details` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `color` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `subtasks` | TEXT | NN | '[]' |\n| `start_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `end_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `start_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `end_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `due_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `completed_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_task_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_task_list_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_parent_task_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_etag` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `google_position` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `google_synced_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `status` | TEXT | NN | 'active' |\n| `sync_id` | TEXT | NN | '' |\n| `sync_origin` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `title_revision` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `title_source` | TEXT | NN | 'dorea' |\n| `period_revision` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `period_source` | TEXT | NN | 'dorea' |\n| `completion_revision` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `completion_source` | TEXT | NN | 'dorea' |\n| `payload_hash` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"eventodos\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    title TEXT NOT NULL,\n    details TEXT,\n    color TEXT,\n    subtasks TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',\n    start_date TEXT,\n    end_date TEXT,\n    start_time TEXT,\n    end_time TEXT,\n    due_date TEXT,\n    completed_date TEXT,\n    google_task_id TEXT,\n    google_task_list_id TEXT,\n    google_parent_task_id TEXT,\n    google_etag TEXT,\n    google_updated_at INTEGER,\n    google_position TEXT,\n    google_synced_at INTEGER,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n, status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active', sync_id TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '', sync_origin TEXT\n    CHECK (sync_origin IS NULL OR sync_origin = 'montoday'), title_revision INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, title_source TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'dorea', period_revision INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, period_source TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'dorea', completion_revision INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, completion_source TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'dorea', payload_hash TEXT);\n```\n\n### google_task_lists\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `title` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `is_default` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `is_enabled` | INTEGER | NN | 1 |\n| `sync_token` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `last_synced_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"google_task_lists\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    title TEXT NOT NULL,\n    is_default INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    is_enabled INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\n    sync_token TEXT,\n    last_synced_at INTEGER,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### habit_log_tags\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `record_id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `tag_id` | TEXT | NN, PK(2) | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| tag_id | habit_tags.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n| record_id | habit_logs.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"habit_log_tags\" (\n    record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    tag_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    PRIMARY KEY (record_id, tag_id),\n    FOREIGN KEY (record_id) REFERENCES \"habit_logs\"(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    FOREIGN KEY (tag_id) REFERENCES habit_tags(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### habit_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `habit_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `log_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `memo` | TEXT | NN | '' |\n| `time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| habit_id | habits.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"habit_logs\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    habit_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    log_date TEXT NOT NULL,                      -- \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n    memo TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',\n    time TEXT,                               -- \"HH:mm\" actual completion time\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    FOREIGN KEY (habit_id) REFERENCES \"habits\"(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### habit_tags\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `habit_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `order_num` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| habit_id | habits.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE habit_tags (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    habit_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    order_num INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    FOREIGN KEY (habit_id) REFERENCES \"habits\"(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### habits\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `icon` | TEXT | NN | '✅' |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `color` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `color_bg` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `status` | TEXT | NN | 'active' |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `review` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"habits\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    icon TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '✅',\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    color TEXT,\n    color_bg TEXT,\n    status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',   -- 'active' | 'inbox' | 'archived'\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER,\n    review TEXT\n);\n```\n\n### ideas\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `note_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `content` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `memos` | TEXT | NN | '[]' |\n| `likes` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `tag_id` | TEXT |  | NULL |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | NULL |\n| `device_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `log_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `record_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| tag_id | tags.id | NO ACTION | SET NULL |\n| note_id | notes.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"ideas\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    note_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    content TEXT NOT NULL,\n    memos TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',\n    likes INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    tag_id TEXT DEFAULT NULL, deleted_at INTEGER DEFAULT NULL, device_id TEXT, log_date TEXT, record_time TEXT,\n    FOREIGN KEY (note_id) REFERENCES \"notes\"(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    FOREIGN KEY (tag_id) REFERENCES \"tags\"(id) ON DELETE SET NULL\n);\n```\n\n### insight_contexts\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `source_type` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `source_title` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `source_summary` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `period_start` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `period_end` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `selected_sources` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `insight` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `agent_profile` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `evidence` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `confidence` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `risk` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE insight_contexts (\n\tid TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n\tsource_type TEXT NOT NULL,\n\tsource_title TEXT NOT NULL,\n\tsource_summary TEXT NOT NULL,\n\tperiod_start TEXT,\n\tperiod_end TEXT,\n\tselected_sources TEXT,\n\tinsight TEXT,\n\tagent_profile TEXT,\n\tcreated_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n\tupdated_at INTEGER\n, evidence TEXT, confidence TEXT, risk TEXT);\n```\n\n### lan_sync_nonces\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `device_id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `nonce` | TEXT | NN, PK(2) | — |\n| `received_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| device_id | sync_peers.device_id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE lan_sync_nonces (\n    device_id  TEXT NOT NULL,\n    nonce      TEXT NOT NULL,\n    received_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    PRIMARY KEY (device_id, nonce),\n    FOREIGN KEY (device_id) REFERENCES sync_peers(device_id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### meal_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `log_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `meal_type` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `menu` | TEXT | NN | '' |\n| `reaction` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE meal_logs (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    log_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    meal_type TEXT NOT NULL,\n    time TEXT,\n    menu TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',\n    reaction TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### money_categories\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `sort_order` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE money_categories (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    sort_order INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### money_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `category_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `log_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `amount` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `direction` | TEXT | NN | 'out' |\n| `memo` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `satisfaction` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| category_id | money_categories.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"money_logs\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    category_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    log_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    amount INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    direction TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'out',\n    memo TEXT,\n    satisfaction TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    FOREIGN KEY (category_id) REFERENCES money_categories(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### money_recurring_items\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `category_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `due_day` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `default_amount` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `sort_order` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `balance_effect` | TEXT | NN | 'out' |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| category_id | money_categories.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE money_recurring_items (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    category_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    due_day INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    default_amount INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    sort_order INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER, balance_effect TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'out'\n    CHECK (balance_effect IN ('in', 'out', 'none')),\n    FOREIGN KEY (category_id) REFERENCES money_categories(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### money_recurring_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `recurring_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `year_month` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `money_log_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `paid_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `amount` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `memo` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| money_log_id | money_logs.id | NO ACTION | SET NULL |\n| recurring_id | money_recurring_items.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE money_recurring_logs (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    recurring_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    year_month TEXT NOT NULL,\n    money_log_id TEXT,\n    paid_at INTEGER,\n    amount INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    memo TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    UNIQUE(recurring_id, year_month),\n    FOREIGN KEY (recurring_id) REFERENCES money_recurring_items(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    FOREIGN KEY (money_log_id) REFERENCES money_logs(id) ON DELETE SET NULL\n);\n```\n\n### notes\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `title` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `icon` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `color` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | NULL |\n| `device_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `status` | TEXT | NN | 'active' |\n| `review` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"notes\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    title TEXT NOT NULL,\n    icon TEXT NOT NULL,\n    color TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL\n, deleted_at INTEGER DEFAULT NULL, device_id TEXT, status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active', review TEXT);\n```\n\n### pending_conflicts\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `table_name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `record_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `local_data` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `remote_data` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `conflict_fields` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `detected_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `resolved_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `resolution` | TEXT |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE pending_conflicts (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    table_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    local_data TEXT NOT NULL,   -- JSON of local record\n    remote_data TEXT NOT NULL,  -- JSON of remote record\n    conflict_fields TEXT NOT NULL,  -- JSON array of conflicting field names\n    detected_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    resolved_at INTEGER,        -- NULL until resolved\n    resolution TEXT             -- 'local', 'remote', 'merged', or merged JSON data\n);\n```\n\n### routines\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `activity` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `activity_ref_id` | TEXT | NN, PK(2) | '' |\n| `duration` | TEXT | NN, PK(3) | — |\n| `start_time` | TEXT | NN, PK(4) | — |\n| `end_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `alarm_enable` | INTEGER | NN | 1 |\n| `alarm_sound_index` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `effective_start_date` | TEXT | NN, PK(5) | — |\n| `effective_end_date` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE routines (\n    activity TEXT NOT NULL,\n    activity_ref_id TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',\n    duration TEXT NOT NULL,\n    start_time TEXT NOT NULL,\n    end_time TEXT,\n    alarm_enable INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\n    alarm_sound_index INTEGER,\n    effective_start_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    effective_end_date TEXT,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    PRIMARY KEY (activity, activity_ref_id, duration, start_time, effective_start_date),\n    CHECK (effective_end_date IS NULL OR effective_end_date >= effective_start_date)\n);\n```\n\n### sleep_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | NN, PK(1) | — |\n| `log_date` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `sleep_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `wake_time` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `memo` | TEXT | NN | '' |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"sleep_logs\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n    log_date TEXT NOT NULL,\n    sleep_time TEXT,\n    wake_time TEXT,\n    memo TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER,\n    deleted_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### sqlite_sequence\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `name` |  |  | — |\n| `seq` |  |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sqlite_sequence(name,seq);\n```\n\n### sync_meta\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `key` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `value` | TEXT | NN | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_meta (\n    key TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    value TEXT NOT NULL\n);\n```\n\n### sync_peers\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `device_id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `device_name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `key_ref` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `last_address` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `last_seen_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `last_sync_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `last_data_sync_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n| `last_settings_sync_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_peers (\n    device_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    device_name   TEXT NOT NULL,\n    key_ref       TEXT NOT NULL,\n    last_address  TEXT,\n    last_seen_at  INTEGER,\n    last_sync_at  INTEGER,\n    created_at    INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at    INTEGER NOT NULL\n, last_data_sync_at INTEGER, last_settings_sync_at INTEGER);\n```\n\n### sync_state\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | INTEGER | PK(1) | — |\n| `current_revision` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `last_synced_revision` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `last_sync_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_state (\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY CHECK (id = 1),\n    current_revision INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK (current_revision >= 0),\n    last_synced_revision INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0\n        CHECK (last_synced_revision >= 0 AND last_synced_revision <= current_revision),\n    last_sync_at INTEGER\n);\n```\n\n### tags\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `note_id` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `name` | TEXT | NN | — |\n| `order_num` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | NULL |\n| `device_id` | TEXT |  | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | — |\n\n| FK | 부모 | ON UPDATE | ON DELETE |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| note_id | notes.id | NO ACTION | CASCADE |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE \"tags\" (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    note_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    order_num INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL, deleted_at INTEGER DEFAULT NULL, device_id TEXT, updated_at INTEGER,\n    FOREIGN KEY (note_id) REFERENCES \"notes\"(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n);\n```\n\n### timer_logs\n\n| 열 | 타입 | 제약 | 기본값 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `id` | TEXT | PK(1) | — |\n| `cycles` | TEXT | NN | '[]' |\n| `total_time` | INTEGER | NN | 0 |\n| `created_at` | INTEGER | NN | — |\n| `updated_at` | INTEGER |  | NULL |\n| `deleted_at` | INTEGER |  | NULL |\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE timer_logs (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    cycles TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',\n    total_time INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n    updated_at INTEGER DEFAULT NULL\n, deleted_at INTEGER DEFAULT NULL);\n```\n\n## 전체 인덱스\n\n중복처럼 보이는 인덱스도 삭제 승인이 아니라 측정 후 정리 후보다. 부분 인덱스는 tombstone을 포함하는 FK 검사와 모든 쿼리를 대체하지 못한다.\n\n- `idx_app_settings_deleted_at` → `app_settings`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_app_settings_deleted_at ON app_settings(deleted_at);\n```\n\n- `idx_app_settings_updated_at` → `app_settings`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_app_settings_updated_at ON app_settings(updated_at);\n```\n\n- `idx_diary_feedback_responses_feedback_created` → `diary_feedback_responses`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_diary_feedback_responses_feedback_created\nON diary_feedback_responses(diary_feedback_id, deleted_at, created_at, id);\n```\n\n- `idx_diary_schedules_activity_active` → `diary_schedules`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_diary_schedules_activity_active\nON diary_schedules(activity, activity_ref_id, created_at)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND activity_ref_id IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_diary_schedules_date_active` → `diary_schedules`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_diary_schedules_date_active\nON diary_schedules(specific_date, start_time, created_at)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_diary_schedules_eventodo_occurrence_active` → `diary_schedules`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_diary_schedules_eventodo_occurrence_active\nON diary_schedules(activity, activity_ref_id, specific_date)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND activity = 'event' AND specific_date IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_active_updated_created` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_active_updated_created\nON eventodos(updated_at DESC, created_at DESC)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_completed_date_active` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_completed_date_active\nON eventodos(completed_date)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND completed_date IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_due_date_active` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_due_date_active\nON eventodos(due_date)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND due_date IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_google_task_id` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_google_task_id\nON eventodos(google_task_id)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND google_task_id IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_google_task_list_id` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_google_task_list_id\nON eventodos(google_task_list_id)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND google_task_list_id IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_start_date_active` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_eventodos_start_date_active\nON eventodos(start_date, start_time, created_at)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND start_date IS NOT NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_eventodos_sync_id` → `eventodos`\n\n```sql\nCREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_eventodos_sync_id\nON eventodos(sync_id)\nWHERE sync_id <> '';\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_log_tags_tag` → `habit_log_tags`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_log_tags_tag ON habit_log_tags(tag_id);\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_logs_habit_log_date_active` → `habit_logs`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_logs_habit_log_date_active\n    ON habit_logs(habit_id, log_date) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_logs_log_date` → `habit_logs`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_logs_log_date\n    ON habit_logs(log_date);\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_logs_log_date_time_active` → `habit_logs`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_logs_log_date_time_active\nON habit_logs(log_date, time, created_at)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_tags_habit_active_order` → `habit_tags`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_tags_habit_active_order\nON habit_tags(habit_id, order_num, created_at)\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_tags_habit_id` → `habit_tags`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_tags_habit_id ON habit_tags(habit_id);\n```\n\n- `idx_habit_tags_name` → `habit_tags`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habit_tags_name ON habit_tags(name);\n```\n\n- `idx_habits_status` → `habits`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_habits_status ON habits(status);\n```\n\n- `idx_ideas_deleted` → `ideas`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_ideas_deleted ON ideas(deleted_at);\n```\n\n- `idx_ideas_deleted_likes_created` → `ideas`\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx_ideas_deleted_likes_created\n    ON ideas(deleted_at, likes DESC, created_at DESC);\n```\n\n- `idx_ideas_log_date