qlite_autoindex_sync_meta_1` → `sync_meta` (SQLite 자동 PK/UNIQUE)\n  - key: key\n\n- `sqlite_autoindex_sync_peers_1` → `sync_peers` (SQLite 자동 PK/UNIQUE)\n  - key: device_id\n\n- `sqlite_autoindex_tags_1` → `tags` (SQLite 자동 PK/UNIQUE)\n  - key: id\n\n- `sqlite_autoindex_timer_logs_1` → `timer_logs` (SQLite 자동 PK/UNIQUE)\n  - key: id\n\n## 전체 트리거\n\n원문 SQL 기준 목록이다. sync revision trigger를 일괄 제거하거나 transaction당 1회로 바꾸려면 Rust·Android·import 등 모든 writer가 dirty 상태를 동일하게 보장해야 한다.\n\n### trg_app_settings_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_app_settings_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON app_settings BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_app_settings_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_app_settings_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON app_settings BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON diary_feedback_responses BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON diary_feedback_responses BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_feedback_responses_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON diary_feedback_responses BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON diary_money_budgets BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON diary_money_budgets BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_money_budgets_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON diary_money_budgets BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON diary_occurrence_records BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON diary_occurrence_records BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_occurrence_records_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON diary_occurrence_records BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_schedules_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_schedules_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON diary_schedules BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_diary_schedules_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_diary_schedules_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON diary_schedules BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_eventodos_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_eventodos_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON eventodos BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state