WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_logs_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_logs_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON money_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON money_recurring_items BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON money_recurring_items BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_items_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON money_recurring_items BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON money_recurring_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON money_recurring_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_money_recurring_logs_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON money_recurring_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_notes_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_notes_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON notes BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_notes_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_notes_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON notes BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_routines_sync_revision_delete\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_routines_sync_revision_delete AFTER DELETE ON routines BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_routines_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_routines_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON routines BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_routines_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_routines_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON routines BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_sleep_logs_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_sleep_logs_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON sleep_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_sleep_logs_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_sleep_logs_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON sleep_logs BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_tags_sync_revision_insert\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_tags_sync_revision_insert AFTER INSERT ON tags BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n### trg_tags_sync_revision_update\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER trg_tags_sync_revision_update AFTER UPDATE ON tags BEGIN\n    UPDATE sync_state SET current_revision = current_revision + 1 WHERE id = 1;\nEND;\n```\n\n## 스키마 구조에서 확인된 검토 후보\n\n1. `idx_money_logs_log_date`는 `(log_date, created_at)`의 left prefix, `idx_notes_deleted`는 `(deleted_at, created_at DESC)`의 left prefix, `idx_ideas_deleted`는 `(deleted_at, likes DESC, created_at DESC)`의 left prefix다. 논리적으로 상당 부분 겹치지만 좁은 인덱스의 size/cache 이점도 있어 대표 쿼리 EQP·쓰기 비용 후 제거 결정한다.\n2. `ideas.note_id`, `tags.note_id`, `habit_logs.habit_id`의 관련 인덱스는 active-only 부분 인덱스다. 부모 물리 삭제의 FK 검색은 tombstone까지 찾아야 하므로 전체 자식 FK를 커버하지 못한다. 실사용 물리 삭제 빈도와 EQP를 확인해 일반 인덱스 교체/추가 여부를 결정한다.\n3. `routines` PK는 5개 TEXT 열, 보조 index는 같은 prefix + effective_end_date다. 상당한 중복이지만 covering 효과가 가능하므로 무조건 삭제하지 않는다. `WITHOUT ROWID`는 작은 composite-key 테이블의 benchmark 후보이며 즉시 migration 권장 아님.\n4. `timer_logs.cycles`, `eventodos.subtasks`, `ideas.memos` JSON은 간단한 원자 저장에는 편리하나 기간 검색/부분 갱신/집계를 위해 반복 전체 parse가 필요할 수 있다. frontend에서 계산을 줄이려면 먼저 Rust projection과 범위 제한을 적용하고, 부하가 증명되는 JSON만 정규화한다.\n5. TEXT UUID를 INTEGER로 전면 변경하거나 논리 날짜 `YYYY-MM-DD`를 timestamp로 일괄 바꾸는 것은 동기화 identity와 dawn-aware 날짜 의미에 비해 위험이 크다. 날짜 의미를 유지한 range predicate와 필요 인덱스가 우선이다.\n6. 040의 occurrence 인덱스는 logical_date와 event actual_date 중심이다. schedule_id/routine_key가 조회 hot path가 될 경우 실제 SQL과 EQP에서 검토한다. FK 부재는 plan 삭제 후 기록 보존 의도이므로 단순 누락으로 취급하지 않는다.\n\n## 현재 fresh schema에서 사라진 legacy 구조\n\n`books`→`notes`, `quotes`→`ideas`, `tags.book_id`→`tags.note_id` 변환 완료. `tasks`, `events`, `task_activity_links`, `task_logs`, `pinned`, reading 전용 cycles/logs 및 `quote_embeddings`/`idea_embeddings`, `change_log`는 현재 테이블 목록에 없다. 현재 Google 연결은 `eventodos.google_*`와 `google_task_lists`; 구형 `gcal_*` 구조와 구분해야 한다. `change_log` 대신 단일행 `sync_state` revision 방식이다. `_migrations`는 000 consolidated 및 후속 migration bookkeeping이며 `sqlite_sequence`는 자동 내부 테이블이다.\n\n## fresh migration 실행 기록\n\n| Migration | 실행 분기 |\n|---|---|\n| 000_consolidated_schema | applied |\n| 001_add_task_activity_link_schedule_ref | skip missing legacy task_activity_links |\n| 002_drop_task_logs | applied |\n| 003_cleanup_orphan_activity_records | skip missing legacy tasks/events |\n| 004_add_task_activity_link_activity_schedule_id | skip missing legacy task_activity_links |\n| 005_task_activity_links_occurrence_identity | skip missing legacy task_activity_links |\n| 006_db_hot_path_indexes | applied |\n| 007_seed_food_money_category | applied |\n| 008_drop_legacy_migration_tables | applied |\n| 009_add_diary_schedule_end_date | applied |\n| 010_task_activity_link_log_date_index | skip missing legacy task_activity_links |\n| 011_recover_legacy_event_schedules | skip missing legacy events |\n| 012_lan_sync | applied |\n| 013_split_lan_sync_timestamps | applied |\n| 015_global_lifestyle_routines | runner seed branch |\n| 017_remove_google_integrations | applied |\n| 018_remove_pinned | applied |\n| 019_create_eventodos_table | applied |\n| 020_backfill_eventodos_from_tasks_and_events | skip missing legacy tasks/events |\n| 021_drop_legacy_tasks_and_events | applied |\n| 022_add_google_columns_to_eventodos | skip already-present google columns |\n| 023_add_note_to_diary_schedules | applied |\n| 024_add_status_to_books_and_eventodos | applied |\n| 025_routines_activity_ref_and_time_range | applied |\n| 026_routines_alarm_columns | applied |\n| 027_remove_dawn_cutoff_setting | applied |\n| 028_notes_ideas_drop_reading | applied |\n| 029_notes_ideas_drop_reading_retry | skip already-converted notes |\n| 030_add_habit_review | skip already-present review |\n| 031_drop_idea_embeddings | applied |\n| 032_routine_effective_dates | applied |\n| 033_diary_feedback_responses | applied |\n| 034_eventodo_sync_and_sparse_schedules | applied |\n| 035_collapse_duplicate_eventodo_schedules | applied |\n| 036_replace_change_log_with_sync_state | applied |\n| 037_canonicalize_legacy_task_schedules | 037 SQL + 035 collapse helper |\n| 038_migrate_legacy_task_schedules_to_eventodos | 037 SQL + 035 collapse helper |\n| 039_routine_time_slot_identity | applied |\n| 040_diary_occurrence_records | applied |\n\n## 빈 fresh schema의 FK lookup EQP 근거\n\n다음은 FK 검사에 필요한 부모 ID별 전체 자식 탐색과 동형인 쿼리다. seed만 있는 DB이므로 실제 지연 시간이나 데이터 규모 효과를 주장하지 않으며, 현 인덱스의 predicate 적용 가능성만 확인했다.\n\n| SQL | EQP detail |\n|---|---|\n| `SELECT rowid FROM ideas WHERE note_id=?` | SCAN ideas |\n| `SELECT rowid FROM tags WHERE note_id=?` | SCAN tags |\n| `SELECT rowid FROM habit_logs WHERE habit_id=?` | SCAN habit_logs |\n| `SELECT rowid FROM habit_tags WHERE habit_id=?` | SEARCH habit_tags USING COVERING INDEX idx_habit_tags_habit_id (habit_id=?) |","folderId":"folder-a575da43f5b8e11f","format":"layall-note","highlights":[],"noteId":"note-ea880385-d75f-4742-9ea5-04aa6e6146b6","pageId":"page-1791181209015-21655bc0f1278","permalink":"a-erd-674bb1b4","postId":"post-674bb1b4726497ee08fe2e1a988a3e07","publishOptions":{"folderId":"folder-a575da43f5b8e11f","includeAttachments":true,"includeHighlights":true,"includeSummaries":false,"includeTags":true,"includeTasks":false},"revision":1,"sourceUpdatedAt":1792309485173,"summaries":[],"tags":[],"tasks":[],"title":"[261005 Dorea DB·데이터 흐름 성능 분석] 부록 A. 전체 스키마·ERD·인덱스·트리거","version":1}